/bn
node_modules/

# Everything `npm run test:e2e` generates: the fixture manifest naming this
# run's throwaway vaults, and Playwright's traces and screenshots. The fixture
# itself lives under the system temporary directory and is never in the
# checkout; this is only what points at it.
/internal/web/e2e/.artifacts/

# A user's global ignore file can quietly swallow a retained narrative: on a
# case-insensitive volume a pattern like `BRAIN[A-Z]*` matches
# `brainnotes_ci.txt`, so the evidence record ends up naming a file the
# repository never carried. The evidence is the artifact the verifier re-hashes,
# so nothing under here is ever ignorable.
!/docs/operations/vault-safety-evidence/
!/docs/operations/vault-safety-evidence/**
